course: dictionary
lesson: 977
title: Boar: one word, more than one animal
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: A boar is a wild pig with thick, bristly hair and sharp tusks. It lives in forests in Europe, Asia and North Africa. In «Wild boar dig up the forest floor with their snouts for roots and worms», the word wild tells you which kind of boar is meant.
explain: Boar has a second meaning on a farm. An adult male pig is also called a boar, and the female is a sow. So the same word can name a wild animal in a forest or a farm animal in a field. The words around it show you which one the writer means.
explain: Some other animals have a male called a boar too, such as the guinea pig and the badger. Read the whole sentence before you decide. Ask yourself: what kind of animal is this text about?
explain: When you are not sure, check the clues and swap in your meaning. If the sentence still makes sense with wild pig, a wild boar is the right choice. If it talks about an animal in a forest, a farm boar would not fit.
fact: A boar is a wild pig with thick, bristly hair and sharp tusks.
fact: Wild boar live in forests in Europe, Asia and North Africa.
fact: An adult male pig on a farm is also called a boar; the female is a sow.
fact: Wild boar use their snouts to dig up roots, nuts, insects and worms.
fact: The male guinea pig and the male badger can also be called boars.
exercise: What is a wild boar? | *A wild pig with thick, bristly hair and sharp tusks | A farm animal that gives milk | A bird that follows gardeners | A wild cat that climbs trees
exercise: «Wild boar dig up the forest floor with their snouts.» What do boar dig for with their snouts? | Seeds from a sky | *Roots and worms | Grass from a farm field | Fish from a river
exercise: The male pig on a farm is a boar. What is the female pig called? | Boar | *Sow | Piglet | Bore
test: Besides pigs, which animal can have a male called a boar? | Raccoon | Fox | Robin | *Guinea pig
test: «A mother with stripy piglets may charge, so go back the way you came.» What should you do if you meet one? | Get between her and her young | Run straight towards her | Stay still and call to her | *Go back the way you came
exam: «In 2020 a boar ran off with a man's bag and laptop at a Berlin lake.» Which kind of boar is this? | *A wild boar | A guinea pig | A sow | A farm pig, the adult male
